---
title: Alert
description: Highlights important messages inline. Use role="status" for polite announcements and role="alert" for urgent errors. Set data-variant to info, success, warning or danger.
tags: [feedback, css]
---

<link rel="stylesheet" href="./styles.css" media="screen">

<div class="alert" role="status" data-variant="info">
  <strong>Heads up!</strong> This is an informational alert.
</div>
<div class="alert" role="alert" data-variant="danger">
  <strong>Error!</strong> Something went wrong.
</div>
